## Introduction

This is the dataset of DFT-SCAN+rVV10 data in CeO$_2$-ZrO$_2$ ceramics for training DeepMD model. Type 1, 2, and 3 are O, Zr, and Ce respectively. The users can refer to Ref. [1] for details.

## General Approach

To be released after the manuscript is published.

